OL,3,AUganda pulling out of Prince Harry's
OL,4,AInvictus Games, says military chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FUganda is pulling out of the Invictus
OL,7,FGames, a sports event for wounded
OL,8,Fmilitary veterans run by the Duke of
OL,9,FSussex, only two months after the
OL,10,Fcountry said it would join.
OL,12,FGeneral Muhoozi Kainerugaba, chief of
OL,13,Fdefence and son of the African
OL,14,Fcountry's president, made the
OL,15,Fannouncement in a social media post on
OL,16,FX.
OL,18,FHe said the decision to withdraw from
OL,19,Fthe games was "in order not to be
OL,20,Fconstrued as being opposed to His
OL,21,FMajesty King Charles III".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
