OL,3,AUganda pulling out of Prince Harry's
OL,4,AInvictus Games, says military chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Uganda government spokesman confirmed
OL,7,Fthis to the BBC: "General Kainerugaba
OL,8,Fdecides whether or not the UPDF [Uganda
OL,9,FPeople's Defence Force] participates in
OL,10,Fthe Invictus Games. What you saw is his
OL,11,Fstated position. If it changes, he will
OL,12,Flet the world know."
